# Crates too slow for a normal-walltime benchmark job: each of these blew a
# 2h walltime SOLO (one whole worker) in the 2026-07-10 miri hyperfine sweep
# of top_500_fast. run_bench_dataset.sh reads this file automatically and
# isolates any of these that appear in a run into ONE dedicated sbatch job
# (one worker per crate), so the regular jobs stay short and cheap.
